  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 760004,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 180: A Dartboard Duel for MSX\n\nStep up to the oche in *180*, a thrilling darts simulation for the MSX! Immerse yourself in the competitive world of professional darts, where precision and nerves of steel are your greatest assets. Choose from a roster of unique characters, each with their own personality and skill set, and test your mettle against increasingly challenging computer opponents.\n\nThe game offers a robust single-player campaign, guiding you through a tournament structure where you must conquer each round to reach the championship. Master various darting techniques, from classic three-dart throws to trick shots, and strategically aim for doubles and triples to rack up points. \n\nBeyond the single-player mode, *180* provides head-to-head multiplayer action for two players, allowing you to challenge friends and family to a virtual dartboard duel. Experience the excitement of a real match, complete with authentic sound effects and a vibrant visual presentation, as you strive for the perfect score and ultimate victory. Can you hit the bullseye and become a darts champion?"
    },
